-- Tests of ie-acts-referred-to.l4: the 18 rows of the table headed "Acts Referred to".
-- Every expected value was typed from the row of the text it names (line numbers 56 to 73 of No.-23-of-2005.txt), not from the module.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ie-acts-referred-to`

§ `Rows with a calendar year and a consecutive number`

-- line 56: Adoption Act 1976 | 1976, No. 29
#ASSERT (`the row of Acts Referred to for` `Adoption Act 1976`)'s `the title` EQUALS "Adoption Act 1976"
#ASSERT (`the row of Acts Referred to for` `Adoption Act 1976`)'s `the citation printed beside it` EQUALS JUST "1976, No. 29"
#ASSERT (`the row of Acts Referred to for` `Adoption Act 1976`)'s `the calendar year in that citation` EQUALS JUST 1976
#ASSERT (`the row of Acts Referred to for` `Adoption Act 1976`)'s `the consecutive number in that citation` EQUALS JUST 29
